37:           "type": "array",
38:           "items": {"type": "string", "enum": ["python", "java", "nodejs", "cpp", "rust", "go", "dotnet", "other"]},
39:           "description": "model: 该库在核心生态之外对外提供绑定/包装的语言生态（如 C++ 核心 + Python/Java/C# 绑定 → [python, java, dotnet]）。无则 []。用于多语言库的生态展示。"
40:         }
